%description:
Tests synRetries on the passive side. The server, a listener that does not
fork, sends its SYN-ACK again at most twice, with an initial RTO of 1 s. The
tester removes each ACK of the client, so the SYN-ACKs go at 0, 1 and 3 s,
and at the third timeout (t=7) the setup times out: the server returns to
LISTEN (RFC 9293 section 3.10.7.3), and answers the data of the client at
t=100 with a RST.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

#cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s

*.cli_app.tSend=100s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=100B

# delete ACK of SYN multiple times
*.srv_tcp.initialRto = 1s
*.srv_tcp.synRetries = 2
*.tcptester.script="a2 delete;a3 delete;a4 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 # deleting
[1.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[1.005 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 # deleting
[3.003 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize
[3.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 # deleting
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> LISTEN  (on TIMEOUT_CONN_ESTAB)
[100.001 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:101(100) ack 501 win 16384 
[100.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: R win 0 
cli_tcp: ESTABLISHED --> CLOSED  (on RCV_RST)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Retransmission count during connection setup exceeds 2, giving up
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
